com pneus remold Garantia de 5 anos pelo fabricante', 1028.78, 638.9, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Tires and Wheels > Automobile Tires', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-mdov0p2zxxw1e3', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1311743114%2F23593963163', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
